    "title": "$18 million grant funds construction on new veterans cemetery in north Alabama - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Megan Plotka ,\n1 days ago Grant funding through the Department of Veterans Affairs National Cemetery Administration will go to build a new cemetery in the state while expanding another. According to the NCA, $18 million will go towards establishing a new state veterans cemetery in northern Huntsville. Another $283,200 will fund the expansion of the Alabama State Veterans Memorial Cemetery in Spanish Fort. Read full article\n12",
